CSM Inference
Copyright 2026 Mike

This project provides an independent inference implementation for Sesame CSM-1B.
It uses Hugging Face Transformers and the separately downloaded Sesame CSM-1B
checkpoint. Upstream projects and model weights retain their own licenses.

Sesame CSM: https://github.com/SesameAILabs/csm
CSM-1B model: https://huggingface.co/sesame/csm-1b
Transformers: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Sesame.

Voice Lab adaptation: typed package boundaries, request validation, lifecycle
ownership, experiment reporting, and FastAPI transport.
